OL,3,ATemperatures set to fall as rain and
OL,4,Acloud sweep across UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter weeks of unusually warm weather,
OL,7,Fautumn is finally set to make its
OL,8,Fpresence felt on Tuesday as cooler air
OL,9,Fsweeps across the UK from the
OL,10,Fnorth-west.
OL,12,FTemperatures will plunge from the low
OL,13,F20s to the mid-teens. Wednesday could
OL,14,Fbe the first day since June when
OL,15,Ftemperatures stay below 20C across the
OL,16,Fwhole of the country.
OL,18,FA spell of rain and stronger winds will
OL,19,Faccompany the colder air, adding to the
OL,20,Fautumnal feel.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
